  dialogue:
  - The White Lady hasn't come to play the song.
  - The song is long lost.
  - Find the quiet song.
  - It will make the pain disappear...
  - Where is the song?
  - The White Lady always sang the song.
  - She always read those stories after she sang.
  - She hasn't came back in a long time...
  - The Black Thing came
  - It took everything away...
